description	"Ubese Scout

An effective scout, the Ubese seeks out long range engagements from high vantage points. Completely sealed within their environmental gear, they are effectively immune to battlefield hazards.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Ubese Neurotoxin Canister (Frag 4)
-- Poisons/Cripples/Force Focuses/Tracks/Slips
-- Large Splash Radius, 0 Damage
-- Fast RoF

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- Close Combat (3)
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Grapple Hop 
- Ubese Environment Protection Suit (Environmental Protection 3)
- Advanced Filters (Immune To Sonic/Poison/Sonic/Locational Damage/Drowning)
- Suit Reliance (5x damage from Ion/Pulse)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Speciality Tracking Darts (8) ^3[CS3]
-- Poisons/Cripples
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]"
